<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 19.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 19.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  May 19		 May 16</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.799		  5.241</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  29.770		 27.315</p>
<p>Cash balance		  34.569		 32.555</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,258.494	     5,257.440</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $85 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
